    "Keyword": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "A single skill. A string officially; an object here.\n\n`level` and `last_used` are a candid self-assessment of an inventory the\nwebsite publishes in full, which is why they are withheld: a public\n`familiar` beside a stale `last_used` reads as a disclaimer attached to\none's own skill list. Tailoring needs both \u2014 they are what decides whether a\nskill is worth claiming against a given posting.",
      "properties": {
        "publish": {
          "default": true,
          "description": "False withholds this entry from the public feed only. It has no bearing on a tailored resume or cover letter: an entry withheld from a published website is often exactly the one to lead with in an application. Absent means published.",
